  "body": "Is there a 'do not verify certificate' option that can be set for other services?\r\nCurrently Synapse does not have that setting, so emails cannot be sent on the mail server used.\r\n\r\nWhen we set it to other SMTP servers, we are able to send, so we do not think there is a problem with the Synapse settings.",
